# Sakura Garden (biome: sakura_garden) - 56x48 outdoor, party L18-24
# Zones: entry court (N, paved) | moon pond (NW) | bamboo maze (SW) | shrine
#   precinct + tea house (C) | tengu ridge (NE, off the court) | spider orchard
#   (SE, boss) | maple walk (S return loop). Cycle: court-pond-maze-walk-
#   orchard-precinct-court; the ridge is the one paying spur.
# Tiles: % fieldstone  # plaster  B vermilion  = lattice | . moss , earth
#   : paving ; koi shallows 1 verge 2 path 3 pond-edge 4 stream W/Q deep pond
# Props: T/U/V sakura K bamboo M maple R rock O outcrop A azalea P petals
#   I iris C clover L lantern G torii F fence E ema J statues N bench
#   S signpost H basin X shrine Z tea house D moon bridge
# Monsters: k kappa  u kasa_obake  t karasu_tengu  f kitsune_onmyoji  j jorogumo (boss)
# OPEN WORLD: the north edge x29..31 is carved through to the castle
#   (open_world.yaml); the paving behind it (y1) stays walkable.
# gate: water (11,10) chest_golden - the pond islet, wants Walk on Water
# gate: jump (8,44) spell_lectern - the azalea ring on the Maple Walk, wants Jump
# Reserved secret anchor: the lone azalea between twin lanterns at (24,42).
